          "_name": "features20",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features19\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"7\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Steps\" name=\"steps\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButton\">\n        <header>Step</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#6592e6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Arrows\" name=\"showArrows\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ff0302\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Size\" name=\"arrowsSize\" min=\"10\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"32\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n            <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Arrows Top\" name=\"arrowsTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"150\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\" condition=\"showArrows\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#353535\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButton\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>Planos e Cursos para Acelerar seu Negócio</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Aumente sua produtividade, reduza custos e amplie suas receitas com a orientação certa.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">V</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Curso IA.Playground (R$ 328,00)</b></h4>\n                        <h1 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><i>Sua porta de entrada na IA.</i></b><br></p><div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 250, 250); font-size: 1rem;\">- Imersão prática de 4h (presencial e online) focada na ferramenta Google NotebookLM, com exercícios aplicados diretamente ao seu negócio. Inclui suporte do instrutor, material de apoio e certificado. (Ex-alunos garantem 10% de desconto).</span></div></div><div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div> \n</div><div>\n</div><p></p></div></h1>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 2}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">2</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Plano Essencial (R$ 198,00/mês)</b></h4>\n                        <h1 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b><i>Atualização contínua com investimento acessível</i><br></b><div>\n</div><div>- Mantendo você conectado às novidades da IA. Inclui 1 consulta individual de 1h por mês, 1 encontro ao vivo em grupo e acesso ilimitado aos materiais online. (Ex-alunos garantem 10% de desconto).</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h1>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 3}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">3</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Plano Pró.Business (R$ 328,00/mês)</b><br><b>(Mais Recomendado)</b></h4>\n                        <h1 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\"><b><i>Mentoria e acompanhamento personalizado</i></b><br><div>- A ponte ideal entre o aprendizado prático e a mentoria individual. Inclui todos os benefícios do Plano Essencial mais 4 horas de mentoria individual mensal. (Ex-alunos garantem 10% de desconto).<br><br><div>\n</div><d